      "value": "<p>You touch a creature and end one condition on it: &amp;Reference[blinded], &amp;Reference[deafened], &amp;Reference[paralyzed], or &amp;Reference[poisoned].</p><div class=\"cat-description\"><p><em>midi-qol: Ends the target's blinded, deafened, paralyzed or poisoned condition: the one it has, or the one you choose if it has several. Every effect granting that condition is removed.</em></p><p><em>Automation requires Coven's Automation Toolkit (CAT).</em></p></div>",
